:: LaaB V0.04.03

<strong>=Life as a Boy V0.04.03 "A Hero's Home" Update=</strong>

<strong>=Carter House=</strong>
You can now visit Carter's House after completing the Quest "Carter: First Visit". He lives on Wald Street and can be visited most days. Carter's House has 2 "States", Normal and Swimming. States change what you and your friend are wearing and the activities you can preform. (Note: Beta will only have the "Swim" State.)

<strong>=Carter House Content=</strong>
-5 "Swim" Events in the Backyard.
-4 "Trampoline" Events in the Backyard.
-4 "Play" Events in the Backyard.
-3 "Watch TV" Event in Carter's Bedroom.
-2 Arriving Events (Based on Day of Week)
-4 Leave Events (Based on Time and Fun Levels)
-An Event where you do your Homework with Carter.
-2 Eating Events (One per State)
-2 Bathroom Events (One per State)
-2 Events when going in and out of Pool State. (Special High Comfort/Social Alt when returning to Normal State.)

<strong>=Memories=</strong>
Memories are a new type of Event in LaaB. These are events that do not involve the Player Character. They can be an event from the past, another perspective on an event, or just seeing something that happens to one of the other characters. Once they are unlocked, they can be viewed in the Journal in the Bedroom.
-New Memory "Just Another Night" involving Lynda and Connor Kent. (Unlocked: "Carter: First Visit")

